From 4090f969a0919f63ba1423a5c2afd01b74c72bd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johnny Warnock <johnrwarnock@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:39:46 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] M3: wire card to live HA entities

- Entity-based config for solar, home, eddi, zappi, battery, grid/generator
- Live flow directions and chevron colours from real power readings
- Generator support with hide_when_idle for off-grid sites
- Use HA ha-icon for node icons (old inline SVG icons rendered as text)
- Drop italics, fake hamburger/footer and the broken Google Fonts @import
- Drop zod; remove missing editor element reference
- Larger, mobile-readable labels and sub-labels

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MGAsVi9KeymYMKwGQWucb4
